{"ID":"20240206100515-oxtl30a","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206100515-oxtl30a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100515-oxtl30a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100515-8wl1ray\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100534-kjoxibt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100534-kjoxibt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"芥子（白芥子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902160352"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100515-8wl1ray","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100515-8wl1ray","updated":"20240206100530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、河南、四川、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t白芥子：种子类圆球形，直径11.6mm，种皮深黄色至棕黄色，少数呈红棕色。用放大镜观察，种子表面现微细网状纹理，种脐明显，呈点状。浸水中膨胀，除去种皮，可见子叶两片，沿主脉处相重对折，胚根位于2对折子叶之间。干燥品无臭，味初似油样，后辛辣。粉碎湿润后，发生特殊辛烈臭气。黄芥子：较小，直径12mm。表面黄色至棕黄色，少数呈暗红棕色。研碎后加水浸湿，则产生辛烈的特异臭气。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t温肺豁痰利气，散结通络止痛。用于寒痰喘咳，胸胁胀痛，痰滞经络，关节麻木、疼痛，痰湿流注，阴疽肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100534-kjoxibt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100534-kjoxibt","updated":"20240206100534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100534-66zp394.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723162046-i12zqqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723162046-i12zqqa","updated":"20240723164620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 469px;","style":"width: 459px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥 2-20240723162046-f88zm3d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 459px;\" parent-style=\"width: 469px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 377px;","style":"width: 367px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 5-20240723164616-blsa8cb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 367px;\" parent-style=\"width: 377px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723162623-9mm5h25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723162623-9mm5h25","updated":"20240723162750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子-20240723162623-xb9i04f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 549px;","style":"width: 539px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 1-20240723162750-662h5hj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 539px;\" parent-style=\"width: 549px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723162909-azhef80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723162909-azhef80","updated":"20240723162918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 723px;","style":"width: 713px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 2-20240723162909-a22wzd1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 713px;\" parent-style=\"width: 723px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 455px;","style":"width: 445px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥 1-20240723161604-j3j3zi4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 445px;\" parent-style=\"width: 455px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723164915-txjwapn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723164915-txjwapn","updated":"20240723164956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 686px;","style":"width: 676px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 6-20240723164915-b7bbqtj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 676px;\" parent-style=\"width: 686px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 7-20240723164956-kbydqnj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723165048-k1ss5dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723165048-k1ss5dw","updated":"20240723165048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 486px;","style":"width: 476px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 8-20240723165048-nokuyhx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 476px;\" parent-style=\"width: 486px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 659px;","style":"width: 649px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 4-20240723163120-omteaxc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 649px;\" parent-style=\"width: 659px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723164716-c20b21g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723164716-c20b21g","updated":"20240723165248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 422px;","style":"width: 412px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 3-20240723163033-s15ax8w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 412px;\" parent-style=\"width: 422px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 744px;","style":"width: 734px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 9-20240723165248-8g8w5sz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 734px;\" parent-style=\"width: 744px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723164636-xi2ata9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723164636-xi2ata9","updated":"20240723170710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 569px;","style":"width: 559px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 10-20240723165409-jrj4gc5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 559px;\" parent-style=\"width: 569px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 602px;","style":"width: 592px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芥子 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芥子 12-20240723170710-r637pi0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 592px;\" parent-style=\"width: 602px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723161949-9nw7les","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723161949-9nw7les","updated":"20240723162022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为白芥的种子，白芥叶似油菜花，根似萝卜；"}]},{"ID":"20240723163503-d74ipol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723163503-d74ipol","updated":"20240723163813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：中国人出产的‘芥’，其根磨成末就是芥末，它结的籽叫白芥子；而日本出产的我们称之为芥末的，其实不是叫芥末，它叫山葵，日本出产的芥末（山葵）是绿的，中国的芥末是黄的；"}]},{"ID":"20240723163826-2td7orp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723163826-2td7orp","updated":"20240723164111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：芥末味道刺激，极大震动人的三焦和心包，而且白芥子这个要专门化脾里膜外之痰，像脂肪瘤、纤维瘤类这类不化的阴寒的痰，中医称之为痰核，白芥子能化之；"}]},{"ID":"20240723161950-4ovft7x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240723161950-4ovft7x"}},{"ID":"20240902160346-f1qd1k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-f1qd1k3","updated":"20240902160352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：白芥子"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-505tjgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-505tjgj","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芥子《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-xeyj727","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-xeyj727","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-1uk3mrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-1uk3mrf","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】BáiJièZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-jvfphdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-jvfphdu","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】辣菜子（《中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-2cj95e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-2cj95e6","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为十字花科植物白芥的种子。夏末、秋初果实成熟时割取全株，晒干后，打下种子，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-jl2gvev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-jl2gvev","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】植物形态详\"白芥\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-wiba32b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-wiba32b","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产安徽、河南、山东、四川、河北、陕西、山西等地。以安徽、河南产量为大。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-wd1vt0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-wd1vt0q","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】种子呈圆球形，直径1.1～2.5毫米，较黄芥子为大。表面类白色至淡黄色，光滑。在扩大镜下观察，可见细微的网纹及一暗色小点状的种脐。种皮脆薄易压碎，剥去后有薄膜状的胚乳粘着于种皮内表面。胚黄白色，袖质，二子叶相叠，并于中脉处折起呈马鞍状，胚根亦折转而藏于其间。气无，味先觉油样而后微酸，继感辛辣。以个大、饱满、色白、纯净者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-v3e19uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-v3e19uz","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】白芥子含白芥子甙、芥子碱、芥子酶、脂肪、蛋白质及粘液质。白芥子甙经芥子酶水解，产生异硫氰酸对羟基苄酯（白芥子油），酸性硫酸芥子碱及葡萄糖。酸性硫酸芥子碱经碱性水解可生成芥子酸和胆碱"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-75xis1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-75xis1m","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】炒白芥子：原药簸尽杂质，炒至深黄色，微有香气即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-aatlgn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-aatlgn8","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-feznuto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-feznuto","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-q0icgh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-q0icgh3","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"味辛，性温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-rtvwjwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-rtvwjwr","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②姚可成《食物本草》：\"辛，热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-dxejd2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-dxejd2j","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"辛，温，微毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-abya6td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-abya6td","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-i4q9n19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-i4q9n19","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ht5392h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ht5392h","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-k9wzn79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-k9wzn79","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入肝、脾、肺、胃、心与包络之经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-14k86v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-14k86v9","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-40jl7nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-40jl7nc","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利气豁痰，温中散寒，通络止痛。治痰饮咳喘，胸胁胀满疼痛，反胃呕吐，中风不语，肢体痹痛麻木，脚气，阴疽，肿毒，跌打肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-5ogkw9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-5ogkw9v","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"发汗，主胸膈痰冷上气，面口黄赤。又醋研敷射工毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-jyozpym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-jyozpym","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②陶弘景：\"御恶气暴风，毒肿流四肢疼痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-qfyi0qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-qfyi0qz","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③孙思邀：\"治咳嗽胸胁支满，上气多唾者，每日温酒吞下七粒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-v32rzpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-v32rzpf","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医学入门》：\"利胸膈痰，止翻胃吐食，痰嗽上气，中风不语，面目色黄，安五脏，止夜多小便。又治扑损瘀血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-l74ojdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-l74ojdx","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"利气豁痰，除寒暖中，散肿止痛。治喘嗽反胃，痹木脚气，筋骨腰节诸痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-y7gwt95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-y7gwt95","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《现代实用中药》：\"捣烂如泥，外用作皮肤刺激引赤药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-nqs3ijq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-nqs3ijq","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《药材资料汇编》：\"功能暖胃，增进食欲，并可为中毒后之催吐剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-87cplwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-87cplwl","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《东北药植志》：\"大量用可作麻醉剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-r7g1pki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-r7g1pki","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-fw7c6wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-fw7c6wm","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-s8rudwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-s8rudwx","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺虚咳嗽、阴虚火旺者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ay3dy9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ay3dy9r","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"肺经有热，与夫阴虚火炎，咳嗽生痰者，法在所忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-5f4u82a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-5f4u82a","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"多食昏目、泄气、伤精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-2iikme6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-2iikme6","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-qwzarlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-qwzarlu","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治高年咳嗽，气逆痰痞：紫苏子、白芥子、萝卜子。上三味各洗净，微炒，击碎，看何证多，则以所主者为君，余次之。每剂不过三钱，用生绢小袋盛之，煮作汤饮。（《韩氏医通》三子养亲汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-9dgnvd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-9dgnvd1","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风湿涎痰，结成痞块：外用白芥子为末，醋凋敷患上。内用白芥子为末，神曲打糊丸梧子大。每服三钱，清晨参枣汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-6q4snzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-6q4snzc","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治翻胃，吐食上气，及羸弱不欲动：白芥子，晒干，为末，酒服方寸匕。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ll51xfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ll51xfc","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治伤寒后，肺中风冷，失音不语：白芥子五合（研碎）。用酒煮令半热，带热包裹熨项颈周延，冷则易之。（《圣济总录》芥子酒熨方）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-nn86pm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-nn86pm6","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治臂痛牵引背胛，或辍或作，由荣卫循行失度，痰滞经络，或似瘫痪：真白芥子、木鳖子各三两（麸炒），没药（另研）、桂心、木香各半两。上为末，每服一钱，温酒下。（《妇人良方》白芥子散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-j7dfejo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-j7dfejo","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治风湿脚气肿疼无力：白芥子、芸薹子、蓖麻子、木鳖子（去壳）、白胶香各一两，胡桃五枚（去壳）。上六味，一处捣三千杵，成膏。每用皂子大，摩疼处。（《圣济总录》芥子膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-18tm9od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-18tm9od","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肿毒初起：白芥子末醋调涂之。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-0sym0ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-0sym0ue","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治小儿乳癖：白芥子研末水调，摊膏贴之，以平为期。（《本草权度》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-l61lq5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-l61lq5q","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治牙痛：白芥子、舶上莎罗、芸薹子各一两。捣细罗为散。每用一字，如患左边疼，即吹右鼻中，如患右边，即吹左鼻中，仍先净洗鼻中，吹药。（《圣惠方》白芥子吹鼻散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-wojhc1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-wojhc1u","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-e76055s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-e76055s","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗慢性气管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-llxkvod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-llxkvod","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用10％或20％的白芥于注射液行穴位注射。每次选2～3穴，每穴注射0.5～1毫升，每日1次，7～10天为一疗程。一个疗程结束后休息3～4天。再行第二个疗程。取穴：喘息型以膻中、定喘、肺俞、天突为主，单纯型以天突、中腑、肺俞为主。交替应用。149例患者经1～2疗程，其中单纯型70例，临床治愈10例，显效19例，好转24例，无效17例，总有效率为75.7％；喘息型79例，临床治愈11例，显效29例，好转27例，无效12例，总有效率84.9％。另据157例哮喘型患者的观察结果，有效率为75.8％，显效率为35％。本药对慢性气管炎主要症状和体征的消减都有一定的作用，但从见效的快慢和好转的程度来看，以平喘作用较好，多数患者治疗后痰易吐出，随之气喘明显减轻，以后咳嗽逐步减轻，但无明显消炎作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-u90hams","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-u90hams","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗膝部肿痛"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-6a2iyzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-6a2iyzi","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取白芥子（或黑色芥菜子）2两研末，用烧酒或黄酒调成糊状，包敷患处，干了就换，以局部发泡为度。治疗两例，均有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-xls40ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-xls40ga","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-k5xauus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-k5xauus","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白芥子《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-33g7lzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-33g7lzd","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《唐本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ls898c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ls898c4","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】BáiJièZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-2u8xe2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-2u8xe2v","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】WhiteMustardSeed"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-xvmfuy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-xvmfuy3","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】辣菜子"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-gkwrg4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-gkwrg4z","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-sp1hje3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-sp1hje3","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为十字花科植物白芥SinapisalbaL.的种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-my82k2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-my82k2o","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：SinapisalbaL."}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-lb2zqn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-lb2zqn4","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春播于7-8月采收，秋播于5月中、下旬采收，待果实大部分出现黄色时割下全株，后熟数日，选晴天晒干，脱出子粒，簸除杂质即可入药，每1hm2产7500kg左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-fl3gn1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-fl3gn1g","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】白芥一年生或二年生粗壮草本，高40-120cm。茎直立，具纵棱，上部多分枝，被散生白色硬毛。叶互生。质薄，具柄；茎基部叶片大头现状裂或近全裂，宽椭圆形或卵圆形，长6-15cm，宽2-3cm，顶裂片大。有侧裂片l-3对，边缘具疏齿；茎生叶较小，具短柄，向上裂片数渐少。总状花序顶生或腋牛；萼片小4，绿色，直立，披针形或长圆形．基部具爪；雄蕊6，4长2短，长雄蕊长8.5-9.5mm，短雄蕊长6-6.5mm；雌蕊l，子房长柱形，长9-10mm，密被白争长刺毛。长角果圆柱形长2-2.5cm，密被白色硬刺毛，果瓣在种子间缢缩成念珠状，角果先端具扁平剑形的喙。种子近球形，淡黄色。花期4-6月，果期5-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-t8tg064","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-t8tg064","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】原产于欧洲。我国辽宁、山西、新疆、山东、安徽、四川、云南多有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-w9wonbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-w9wonbp","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-4mgeg8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-4mgeg8b","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全国各地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-rqbzjxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-rqbzjxf","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.气候土壤：以排水良好的砂质壤土为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ds44mlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ds44mlf","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.整地：在土壤干湿度适度，表土略呈白色时，深耕耙细，至播种前翻耕耙细整平，开设排水沟。育苗移栽的并须作好苗床，以1.4-1.5m宽为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-s8e3u43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-s8e3u43","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.苗高3-4cm时，即行匀苗补苗。除草三次。并结合施肥。人畜粪2000-4000斤/亩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-0da9344","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-0da9344","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.种植：在寒露与霜降时，直播或移栽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-vvl9176","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-vvl9176","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.病虫害防治：对菌核病及白锈病，除在播种时以盐水浸种预防外，初期查喷洒波尔多液，并拔除病株后，撒石灰消毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-5as7d2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-5as7d2m","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-pdjv14q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-pdjv14q","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别种子近球形，直径2-2.5mm。表面淡黄白色，光滑，在放大镜下观察，可见细微的网纹，一端具一圆形淡褐色的种脐，浸水中膨胀，去种皮可见2片肥厚的子叶，油质，相互纵向折叠，胚根包藏于其间。气微，味辛辣，粉碎湿润后，有特殊的辛烈臭气。以粒大、饱满、色黄白、纯净者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-i4mb996","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-i4mb996","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别种子横切面：最外为1列切向延长的表皮粘液细胞，其外壁向外特化成粘液层；下皮1-2列细胞，壁薄；栅状细胞1列，其内壁和侧壁的胞1列，其内壁和侧壁的l/2处增厚，外壁菲薄；色素细胞呈颓废状。内胚乳为1列类方形或长方形的细胞，内含糊粉粒，其下方为颓废细胞层。于叶发达，细胞内含糊粉粒和油滴。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-zynxyc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-zynxyc4","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种子含芥子油甙（glucosinolate），内有白芥子甙（sialbin）。还含脂肪油，芥子酶，芥子碱（siapine）和赖氨酸（lysine），精氨酸（arginine），组氨酸（histidine）等氨基酸。又含4-羟基苯甲酰胆碱（4-hydroxybenzoylcholine），4-羟基苯甲胺（4-hydroxybenzylamine）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-vo8dm9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-vo8dm9i","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-krsmhat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-krsmhat","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗菌作用：本品所含的异硫氰酸苄酯具有广谱抗菌作用，对酵母菌、20种真菌及数十种其它菌株均有抗菌作用，对革兰氏阴性或阳性细菌的有效抑菌浓度为1：10(2)-3×10(2)。白芥子水浸液在试管内对堇色毛癣菌、许兰氏黄癣菌等有不同程度的抗真菌作用。黄芥子甙水解产生甙元芥子油亦具杀菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-1u50awm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-1u50awm","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.刺激作用：白芥子甙，本身无刺激作用，遇水后经芥子酶的作用生成挥发性油（白芥子油）。芥子油的主要成分异硫氰酸烯丙酯具刺鼻辛辣味及刺激作用。能使皮肤发红、温暖，甚至引起水泡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-ag26t9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-ag26t9c","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】本品所含的异硫氰酸苄酯对小鼠、豚鼠、大鼠腹腔注射的LD50分别为76-107，68及72mg／kg，口服的LD50分别为134，81及128mg／kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-o8hpg4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-o8hpg4y","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取本品粉末约1g，置硬质试管内，加固体氢氧化钠1粒，酒精灯上灼热，融熔，放冷，加水2ml使溶解，滤过。取滤液lml，加5%盐酸酸化，即有硫化氢产生，遇新制的醋酸铅试纸，显有光泽的棕黑色。（检查异硫氰甙类）（2）取亚硝基铁氰化钠1小粒，置白瓷板上，加水l-2滴使溶解，加上述样品滤液1-2滴，显紫红色。（检查异硫氰甙类）"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-9ciee7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-9ciee7n","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】炒白芥子：原药簸尽杂质，炒至深黄色，微有香气即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-f1ddj2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-f1ddj2j","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；温"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-nbdtc21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-nbdtc21","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；肝；脾；胃；心包经"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-eara4vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-eara4vx","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】化痰逐饮；散结消肿。主咳喘痰多；胸满胁痛；肢体麻木；关节肿痛；湿痰流注；阴疽肿毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-hg97f8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-hg97f8b","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷；治喘咳宜敷贴背部肺俞、心俞、膈痰饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-l770qfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-l770qfs","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】肺虚咳嗽、阴虚火旺者忌服。且多食昏目、泄气、伤精。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-tpjzyf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-tpjzyf9","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-8kjph18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-8kjph18","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《别录》：发汗，主胸膈痰冷上气，面目黄赤。又醋研敷射工毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-qir7q95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-qir7q95","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：御恶气暴风，毒肿流四肢疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-qd8s3yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-qd8s3yj","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.孙思邈：治咳嗽胸胁支满，上气多唾者，每日温酒吞七粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-2usonmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-2usonmn","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《医学入门》：利胸膈痰，止翻胃吐食，痰嗽上气，中风不语，面目色黄，安五脏，止夜多小便。又治扑损瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-mv6xdov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-mv6xdov","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：利气豁痰，除寒暖中，散肿止痛。治喘嗽反胃，痹木脚气，筋骨腰节诸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-vz970jd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-vz970jd","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《现代实用中药》：捣烂如泥，外用作皮肤刺激引赤药。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-oj4blrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-oj4blrf","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《药材资料汇编》：功能暖胃，增进食欲，并可为中毒后之催吐剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-br3e5mw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-br3e5mw","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《东北药植志》：大量用可作麻醉剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902160346-u1tifp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160346-u1tifp3","updated":"20240902160358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902160347-chs6b55","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902160347-chs6b55","updated":"20240902160358"}},{"ID":"20240902160348-570uzpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902160348-570uzpf","updated":"20240902160358"}}]}